1
00:03.050 --> 00:04.350 line:86%
Okay, bismillah.

2
00:04.450 --> 00:05.850 line:86%
Ready? Ready.

3
00:06.350 --> 00:08.150 line:86%
Do I need to double seat belt?

4
00:09.350 --> 00:10.650 line:86%
Okay, seat belt first…

5
00:10.700 --> 00:12.200 line:86%
So they asked me,

6
00:12.200 --> 00:14.000 line:86%
“I just want to ask you…”

7
00:14.500 --> 00:17.400 line:86%
“Your videographer, is he
from Chasing Vows?”

8
00:17.400 --> 00:18.900 line:86%
I was like, “Huh, why?”

9
00:19.000 --> 00:22.100 line:86%
“Because the video
is very similar.”

10
00:22.200 --> 00:23.700 line:86%
“Like Chasing Vows.
The vibe, man.”

11
00:23.800 --> 00:25.400 line:86%
So I said, “Oh, is it?”

12
00:25.500 --> 00:26.500 line:86%
“Nah, he's a freelancer.”

13
00:26.500 --> 00:28.900 line:86%
“He shoots now and then,
but he doesn't edit.”

14
00:29.700 --> 00:30.550 line:86%
“Oh, so who edits?”

15
00:30.600 --> 00:32.200 line:86%
“I edit lah.” “Oh, okay okay.”

16
00:32.300 --> 00:34.400 line:86%
Because the cut is very…
mysterious.

17
00:35.000 --> 00:36.300 line:86%
Then with your voiceover, right?

18
00:36.600 --> 00:39.700 line:86%
I told people, it's like
a drama. Serious!

19
00:40.300 --> 00:42.550 line:86%
Then that one shot
you came in at 85mm…

20
00:42.600 --> 00:43.800 line:86%
…from way back.

21
00:43.900 --> 00:45.400 line:86%
Wah, just nice. Like, the end.

22
00:45.500 --> 00:46.800 line:86%
The ending one, right?

23
00:47.000 --> 00:47.950 line:86%
That one's nice.

24
00:48.100 --> 00:49.500 line:86%
I don't mind the single cam.

25
00:49.600 --> 00:51.000 line:86%
But maybe next time…

26
00:51.000 --> 00:53.700 line:86%
…the single cam,
maybe a bit wider.

27
00:54.000 --> 00:55.900 line:86%
Because yours is too close up.

28
00:56.500 --> 00:57.750 line:86%
You have to go further lah.

29
00:57.800 --> 00:58.850 line:86%
Either you go further…

30
00:58.900 --> 01:01.450 line:86%
…or you get a mid shot.

31
01:01.500 --> 01:03.200 line:86%
Just take a mid shot.

32
01:03.700 --> 01:05.450 line:86%
Like that, it's too tight
for me to use.

33
01:05.500 --> 01:07.850 line:86%
And you were moving so much.

34
01:08.000 --> 01:10.000 line:86%
I just… didn't check the setting.

35
01:10.100 --> 01:12.300 line:86%
At first, I really thought…

36
01:12.500 --> 01:14.400 line:86%
“Eh, what's wrong
with my computer?”

37
01:14.800 --> 01:15.450 line:86%
“Why is everything slow?”

38
01:15.500 --> 01:17.750 line:86%
Right after the ring shot, right?

39
01:17.900 --> 01:18.900 line:86%
Right after the ring shot.

40
01:19.000 --> 01:21.000 line:86%
I was like… everything is slow.

41
01:21.100 --> 01:22.300 line:86%
And that slow-mo, right…

42
01:22.400 --> 01:24.400 line:86%
It's like super slow.
Crazy super slow!

43
01:24.550 --> 01:26.050 line:86%
That's why, my bad. I own it.

44
01:26.150 --> 01:26.700 line:86%
It's okay.

